// 預計開始～結束（C# UI/DateRangePicker.xaml）：點一下跳出並排的兩個月日曆（跟 Hayaku 網頁一樣，週一開始），
// 點第一下是開始、第二下是結束，按「套用日期」才生效。只選一天就套用＝開始和結束同一天；「清除」把兩個日期都清掉。
// single＝只選一天：點一下日期就直接套用。日期一律用 yyyymmdd 整數，0 表示未指定。
import { Theme, Motion, Icon, Icons, IconButton, Button, ButtonKind, Tip } from "@hb/index.slint";

global DateMath {
    pure public function days-in(y: int, m: int) -> int {
        if m == 2 {
            return (mod(y, 4) == 0 && mod(y, 100) != 0) || mod(y, 400) == 0 ? 29 : 28;
        }
        return m == 4 || m == 6 || m == 9 || m == 11 ? 30 : 31;
    }
    /// 0 = 週一 … 6 = 週日
    pure public function weekday(y: int, m: int, d: int) -> int {
        let yy = m < 3 ? y - 1 : y;
        let t = [0, 3, 2, 5, 0, 3, 5, 1, 4, 6, 2, 4][m - 1];
        return mod(mod(yy + floor(yy / 4) - floor(yy / 100) + floor(yy / 400) + t + d, 7) + 6, 7);
    }
    /// 從 0000-03-01 起算的天數（只拿來算差幾天）
    pure public function day-number(v: int) -> int {
        let y0 = floor(v / 10000);
        let m = mod(floor(v / 100), 100);
        let d = mod(v, 100);
        let y = m <= 2 ? y0 - 1 : y0;
        let era = floor(y / 400);
        let yoe = y - era * 400;
        let mp = mod(m + 9, 12);
        let doy = floor((153 * mp + 2) / 5) + d - 1;
        return era * 146097 + yoe * 365 + floor(yoe / 4) - floor(yoe / 100) + doy;
    }
    pure public function pad2(n: int) -> string {
        return (n < 10 ? "0" : "") + n;
    }
    /// yyyy-MM-dd
    pure public function iso(v: int) -> string {
        return floor(v / 10000) + "-" + pad2(mod(floor(v / 100), 100)) + "-" + pad2(mod(v, 100));
    }
    /// M/d
    pure public function md(v: int) -> string {
        return mod(floor(v / 100), 100) + "/" + mod(v, 100);
    }
}

component DayCell {
    in property <int> date;
    in property <bool> in-month;
    in property <bool> today;
    in property <bool> is-from;
    in property <bool> is-to;
    in property <bool> in-range;
    /// 區間有兩天以上（頭尾只畫一半，連成一條）
    in property <bool> band;
    callback picked;
    callback hovered;
    property <bool> endpoint: is-from || is-to;
    property <float> pop: 1;
    property <bool> snap;
    changed endpoint => {
        if endpoint {
            snap = true;
            pop = 0.5;
            snap = false;
            pop = 1;
        }
    }
    animate pop {
        duration: snap ? 0ms : Motion.spring-dur;
        easing: Motion.spring;
    }
    if root.in-range && root.band: Rectangle {
        x: root.is-from ? root.width / 2 : 0px;
        width: root.width - (root.is-from ? root.width / 2 : 0px) - (root.is-to ? root.width / 2 : 0px);
        y: 3px;
        height: root.height - 6px;
        background: Theme.accent-soft;
    }
    Rectangle {
        width: min(root.width, root.height) - 4px;
        height: self.width;
        border-radius: self.width / 2;
        transform-scale: root.pop;
        background: root.endpoint ? Theme.ink : ta.has-hover ? Theme.hover : transparent;
        // 今天：外框（另一個月補位的今天不畫）
        border-width: root.today && root.in-month && !root.endpoint ? 1.5px : 0px;
        border-color: Theme.ink;
        animate background { duration: 200ms; }
        Text {
            text: mod(root.date, 100);
            color: root.endpoint ? Theme.on-ink : Theme.ink;
            opacity: root.in-month || root.endpoint ? 1 : 0.4;
            font-size: Theme.fs-md;
            font-weight: root.endpoint ? 600 : 400;
            font-family: Theme.font-num;
        }
    }
    // 今天：下面一條橘色短線
    if root.today: Rectangle {
        x: (root.width - 12px) / 2;
        y: root.height - 7px;
        width: 12px;
        height: 2px;
        border-radius: 1px;
        background: Theme.accent;
    }
    ta := TouchArea {
        mouse-cursor: pointer;
        clicked => {
            root.picked();
        }
        changed has-hover => {
            if self.has-hover {
                root.hovered();
            }
        }
    }
}

component MonthGrid {
    in property <int> year;
    in property <int> month;
    in property <int> today;
    in property <int> from;
    in property <int> to;
    in property <length> cell-width: 38px;
    in property <length> cell-height: 34px;
    callback picked(date: int);
    callback hovered(date: int);
    property <int> offset: DateMath.weekday(year, month, 1);
    property <int> dim: DateMath.days-in(year, month);
    property <int> prev-y: month == 1 ? year - 1 : year;
    property <int> prev-m: month == 1 ? 12 : month - 1;
    property <int> next-y: month == 12 ? year + 1 : year;
    property <int> next-m: month == 12 ? 1 : month + 1;
    property <int> prev-dim: DateMath.days-in(prev-y, prev-m);
    pure function cell-date(k: int) -> int {
        let d = k - root.offset + 1;
        if d < 1 {
            return (root.prev-y * 100 + root.prev-m) * 100 + root.prev-dim + d;
        }
        if d > root.dim {
            return (root.next-y * 100 + root.next-m) * 100 + d - root.dim;
        }
        return (root.year * 100 + root.month) * 100 + d;
    }
    width: 7 * cell-width;
    height: cell-height - 6px + 6 * cell-height;
    for w[i] in ["一", "二", "三", "四", "五", "六", "日"]: Text {
        x: i * root.cell-width;
        y: 0;
        width: root.cell-width;
        height: root.cell-height - 6px;
        text: w;
        color: Theme.muted;
        font-size: Theme.fs-sm;
        font-weight: 600;
        horizontal-alignment: center;
        vertical-alignment: center;
    }
    for k in 42: DayCell {
        property <int> d: root.cell-date(k);
        x: mod(k, 7) * root.cell-width;
        y: root.cell-height - 6px + floor(k / 7) * root.cell-height;
        width: root.cell-width;
        height: root.cell-height;
        date: self.d;
        in-month: floor(self.d / 100) == root.year * 100 + root.month;
        today: self.d == root.today;
        is-from: root.from > 0 && self.d == root.from;
        is-to: root.to > 0 && self.d == root.to;
        in-range: root.from > 0 && root.to > 0 && self.d >= root.from && self.d <= root.to;
        band: root.from != root.to;
        picked => {
            root.picked(self.d);
        }
        hovered => {
            root.hovered(self.d);
        }
    }
}

component NavButton {
    in property <string> icon;
    in property <string> tip;
    callback clicked;
    width: 30px;
    height: 30px;
    IconButton {
        width: 30px;
        height: 30px;
        radius: 10px;
        icon-size: 15px;
        icon: root.icon;
        kind: ButtonKind.ghost;
        label: root.tip;
        clicked => {
            root.clicked();
        }
    }
    Rectangle {
        Tooltip {
            Tip {
                text: root.tip;
            }
        }
    }
}

export component DateRangePicker {
    /// 已套用的開始、結束（yyyymmdd，0＝未指定）
    in-out property <int> start;
    in-out property <int> end;
    /// 只選一天（例如請半天）：欄位只顯示一個日期，點一下日期就套用
    in property <bool> single: false;
    /// 今天（yyyymmdd）；hb_ui_common::date_range::today_int()
    in property <int> today;
    in property <bool> enabled: true;
    /// 按了「套用日期」或「清除」（值有沒有變由呼叫端比較）
    callback applied();

    property <int> pick-start;
    property <int> pick-end;
    property <int> hover;
    property <int> left-y: 2026;
    property <int> left-m: 1;
    property <int> right-y: left-m == 12 ? left-y + 1 : left-y;
    property <int> right-m: left-m == 12 ? 1 : left-m + 1;
    // 選了開始、還沒選結束時，滑鼠移到哪天就先預覽那一段
    property <int> range-from: pick-start;
    property <int> range-to: !single && pick-start > 0 && pick-end == 0 && hover > 0 && hover > pick-start ? hover : pick-end > 0 ? pick-end : pick-start;
    property <bool> one-sided: !single && (start == 0) != (end == 0);
    property <bool> open: popup.is-open;

    function move(months: int) {
        let total = root.left-y * 12 + root.left-m - 1 + months;
        root.left-y = floor(total / 12);
        root.left-m = mod(total, 12) + 1;
    }
    public function open-calendar() {
        if !root.enabled {
            return;
        }
        root.pick-start = root.start;
        root.pick-end = root.single ? 0 : root.end;
        root.hover = 0;
        let first = root.start > 0 ? root.start : root.today;
        root.left-y = floor(first / 10000);
        root.left-m = mod(floor(first / 100), 100);
        popup.show();
    }
    /// 收起日曆（不套用）
    public function close-calendar() {
        popup.close();
    }
    function pick(day: int) {
        if root.single {
            root.start = day;
            root.end = day;
            popup.close();
            root.applied();
            return;
        }
        if root.pick-start == 0 || root.pick-end != 0 || day < root.pick-start {
            root.pick-start = day;
            root.pick-end = 0;
        } else {
            root.pick-end = day;
        }
    }

    height: 44px;
    min-width: 200px;
    opacity: enabled ? 1 : 0.5;
    accessible-role: combobox;
    accessible-value: start > 0 ? DateMath.iso(start) : "";
    forward-focus: fs;
    fs := FocusScope {
        key-pressed(e) => {
            if e.text == Key.Return || e.text == " " || e.text == Key.DownArrow {
                root.open-calendar();
                return EventResult.accept;
            }
            EventResult.reject
        }
    }
    Rectangle {
        transform-scale: field-ta.pressed ? 0.97 : 1;
        animate transform-scale {
            duration: field-ta.pressed ? Motion.press-dur : Motion.spring-dur;
            easing: field-ta.pressed ? Motion.press : Motion.spring;
        }
        border-radius: Theme.radius-input;
        background: root.open || fs.has-focus ? Theme.card : Theme.fill;
        border-width: 1.5px;
        border-color: root.open || fs.has-focus ? Theme.ink : transparent;
        animate background, border-color { duration: 300ms; }
        HorizontalLayout {
            padding-left: 14px;
            padding-right: 12px;
            spacing: 8px;
            Text {
                horizontal-stretch: 1;
                text: root.start > 0 ? DateMath.iso(root.start) : root.single ? "選擇日期" : root.one-sided ? "未指定" : "開始日期";
                color: root.start > 0 ? Theme.ink : Theme.muted;
                font-size: Theme.fs-md;
                font-weight: 500;
                vertical-alignment: center;
                overflow: elide;
            }
            if !root.single: Text {
                text: "~";
                color: Theme.muted;
                font-size: Theme.fs-md;
                vertical-alignment: center;
            }
            if !root.single: Text {
                horizontal-stretch: 1;
                text: root.end > 0 ? DateMath.iso(root.end) : root.one-sided ? "未指定" : "結束日期";
                color: root.end > 0 ? Theme.ink : Theme.muted;
                font-size: Theme.fs-md;
                font-weight: 500;
                vertical-alignment: center;
                overflow: elide;
            }
            Icon {
                y: (parent.height - self.height) / 2;
                path: Icons.calendar;
                color: Theme.muted;
                width: 16px;
                height: 16px;
            }
        }
    }
    field-ta := TouchArea {
        enabled: root.enabled;
        mouse-cursor: pointer;
        clicked => {
            fs.focus();
            root.open-calendar();
        }
        Tooltip {
            Tip {
                text: "點一下選日期";
            }
        }
    }

    popup := PopupWindow {
        // 四周多留 14px 給陰影
        x: -14px;
        y: root.height + 6px - 14px;
        width: frame.width + 28px;
        height: frame.height + 28px;
        close-policy: PopupClosePolicy.close-on-click-outside;
        frame := Rectangle {
            property <float> t: 0;
            init => {
                t = 1;
            }
            animate t {
                duration: Motion.spring-dur;
                easing: Motion.spring;
            }
            x: 14px;
            y: 14px - 8px * (1 - self.t);
            width: body.preferred-width;
            height: body.preferred-height;
            opacity: clamp(self.t * 1.5, 0, 1);
            transform-scale: 0.96 + 0.04 * self.t;
            transform-origin: { x: 0px, y: 0px };
            border-radius: 20px;
            background: Theme.card;
            border-width: 1px;
            border-color: Theme.line;
            drop-shadow-color: Theme.dark ? #00000080 : #0E0F1329;
            drop-shadow-blur: 24px;
            drop-shadow-offset-y: 10px;
            body := VerticalLayout {
                padding-left: 16px;
                padding-right: 16px;
                padding-top: 12px;
                padding-bottom: 14px;
                spacing: 8px;
                HorizontalLayout {
                    spacing: 24px;
                    // 左邊的月份：« ‹ 2026年  10月
                    Rectangle {
                        width: 7 * 38px;
                        height: 30px;
                        HorizontalLayout {
                            alignment: LayoutAlignment.start;
                            NavButton {
                                icon: "M12 6l-6 6l6 6 M19 6l-6 6l6 6";
                                tip: "上一年";
                                clicked => {
                                    root.move(-12);
                                }
                            }
                            NavButton {
                                icon: Icons.chevron-left;
                                tip: "上個月";
                                clicked => {
                                    root.move(-1);
                                }
                            }
                        }
                        Text {
                            text: root.left-y + "年  " + root.left-m + "月";
                            color: Theme.ink;
                            font-size: Theme.fs-base;
                            font-weight: 700;
                        }
                    }
                    // 右邊的月份：2026年  11月 › »
                    Rectangle {
                        width: 7 * 38px;
                        height: 30px;
                        Text {
                            text: root.right-y + "年  " + root.right-m + "月";
                            color: Theme.ink;
                            font-size: Theme.fs-base;
                            font-weight: 700;
                        }
                        HorizontalLayout {
                            alignment: LayoutAlignment.end;
                            NavButton {
                                icon: Icons.chevron-right;
                                tip: "下個月";
                                clicked => {
                                    root.move(1);
                                }
                            }
                            NavButton {
                                icon: "M5 6l6 6l-6 6 M12 6l6 6l-6 6";
                                tip: "下一年";
                                clicked => {
                                    root.move(12);
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
                HorizontalLayout {
                    spacing: 24px;
                    MonthGrid {
                        year: root.left-y;
                        month: root.left-m;
                        today: root.today;
                        from: root.range-from;
                        to: root.range-to;
                        picked(d) => {
                            root.pick(d);
                        }
                        hovered(d) => {
                            if root.pick-start == 0 || root.pick-end != 0 || root.hover == d {
                                return;
                            }
                            root.hover = d;
                        }
                    }
                    MonthGrid {
                        year: root.right-y;
                        month: root.right-m;
                        today: root.today;
                        from: root.range-from;
                        to: root.range-to;
                        picked(d) => {
                            root.pick(d);
                        }
                        hovered(d) => {
                            if root.pick-start == 0 || root.pick-end != 0 || root.hover == d {
                                return;
                            }
                            root.hover = d;
                        }
                    }
                }
                Rectangle {
                    height: 1px;
                    background: Theme.line;
                }
                Rectangle {
                    height: 38px;
                    HorizontalLayout {
                        alignment: LayoutAlignment.start;
                        spacing: 6px;
                        Button {
                            text: "取消";
                            kind: ButtonKind.secondary;
                            clicked => {
                                popup.close();
                            }
                        }
                        Rectangle {
                            horizontal-stretch: 0;
                            preferred-width: clear.preferred-width;
                            clear := Button {
                                text: "清除";
                                kind: ButtonKind.ghost;
                                clicked => {
                                    root.start = 0;
                                    root.end = 0;
                                    popup.close();
                                    root.applied();
                                }
                            }
                            Tooltip {
                                Tip {
                                    text: "清除預計日期";
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                    Text {
                        text: root.single ? "點一下日期就選好" : root.pick-start == 0 ? "點一下選開始日期" : root.pick-end == 0 ? DateMath.md(root.pick-start) + " ～ 再點結束日期（只選這天就直接套用）" : DateMath.md(root.pick-start) + " ～ " + DateMath.md(root.pick-end) + "，共 " + (DateMath.day-number(root.pick-end) - DateMath.day-number(root.pick-start) + 1) + " 天";
                        color: Theme.muted;
                        font-size: Theme.fs-sm;
                        horizontal-alignment: center;
                        vertical-alignment: center;
                    }
                    HorizontalLayout {
                        alignment: LayoutAlignment.end;
                        Button {
                            text: "套用日期";
                            kind: ButtonKind.primary;
                            clicked => {
                                root.start = root.pick-start;
                                root.end = root.pick-end > 0 ? root.pick-end : root.pick-start; // 只點一天：開始和結束同一天
                                popup.close();
                                root.applied();
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    }
}
